            "review_title": "Review at Mình Ơiii!",
            "review_text": "Febrylian Yovita\nJakarta, Indonesia146 contributions\n0\nMust Try Vietnamese Comfort Food\nMar 2025 • Couples\nReally like all the food we ordered.\nThe only restaurant that sells comfort food on this street. served and cooked by a solid, adorable family.\nAll the food is cooked well from the taste and the level of maturity is very good. Vietnam has a characteristic of simple spices but familiar to the tongue .. I really like it. for those of you who visit here just 1 block from the train cafes you must try this restaurant .. feel the heart of the chef and fam\nRead more\nWritten April 15, 2025",
